note for over a number K with bound N: the latch lands on the hidden counter check after the head's exit
note branch, so bound 3 under K = 10 traps 4 at the start of pass 4 (exit 104); a latch that lands on or
note past the counter's branch runs all 10 passes (exit 10)
om2
fn main to int
s = ulong 0
for i ulong 10 bound 3
s = add s 1
end
ret int s
end
